  "description": "pacman-bteng - BTEng project index. These are BTEng <BTEng> trees, not Groot2/BT.CPP files: they stream live over the BTEng ZmqPublisher on tcp://*:2667, which Groot2 cannot read. Watch them with ./run.sh tree <agent> instead.",
